         Analysis for Dimensionality Reduction in Single Cell
         {RNA-Seq}},
  author={Abdelnaby, Mohamed and Moussa, Marmar R},
  journal={Cancer Informatics},
  year={2026},
  doi={10.1177/15578666261436821},
  note={Published version of the benchmarking study above.}
}
